  "ingredients": [
    "0.5 cup olive oil",
    "0.5 pound potatoes, thinly sliced",
    "salt and pepper to taste",
    "1 large onion, thinly sliced",
    "4 large eggs",
    "2 medium tomatoes - peeled, seeded, and coarsely chopped",
    "2 green onions, chopped"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/MWLzfyHXfi-O5YaS1olv1CiZOEo=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/20198-spanish-potato-omelet-VAT-005-step-01-7e8ca8e60f4a40ff9b2347ba3743f1c5.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/20198/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Heat oil over medium-high heat in a large skillet. Add potatoes and season lightly with salt and pepper; cook, stirring occasionally, until golden brown and crisp, 10 to 14 minutes. Add onions; cook and stir until soft and beginning to brown, 6 to 8 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/djh1mzYhZqikiYfvwpcGddwNm7I=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/20198-spanish-potato-omelet-VAT-006-step-02-b5b29fa6c0c641cf85ac36e76cfad861.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/20198/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Whisk eggs in a bowl; season with salt and pepper.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/wv0PQ8BNrIFATfg1mtFBW8TlWtU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/20198-spanish-potato-omelet-VAT-007-step-03-e8746c32bad742588d49264bd8f76cc6.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/20198/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour eggs into the skillet and stir gently to combine with potatoes and onion. Reduce the heat to low and cook until eggs begin to brown on the bottom, 4 to 5 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/w9o6h7YCsDnZ67WomEFcuqa_7qs=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/20198-spanish-potato-omelet-VAT-008-step-04-01-4a8300ad41bb491385367be9cc2c93d0.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/20198/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Loosen omelette with a spatula. Invert a large plate over the pan, and carefully flip omelette out onto the plate. Slide omelette, uncooked-side down, back into the pan. Cook until eggs are set, 4 to 5 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/7wIXbqbLBPPjJ5Z3rokbjmOWpXk=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/20198-spanish-potato-omelet-VAT-009-step-05-45cadff4f07a474099a1c5f375edba7b.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/20198/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve warm, garnished with tomato and green onion.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/DV_aP-RYcMGyoWiI8KyVctlnM8I=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/20198-spanish-potato-omelet-VAT-003-4x3-7211b604f8364f0d98bd382d8870e592.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/20198/step_06.webp"
    }
